{"id":404008201,"chapter_id":50084,"scene_id":58409,"steps":[{"step":1,"speaker":"医师","content":"呼……这是今天遇到的第几波怪物了？","voice":["vo_event_404008201_01"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_40821","style":1,"background":2000,"log_type":1},{"step":2,"content":"医师从怪物的身体里拔出武器，转了个优雅的圈，巧妙避免了血迹溅到她新换的制服。","style":3,"background":2000,"log_type":1},{"step":3,"speaker":"旧军成员","content":"第三波。","voice":["vo_event_404008201_03"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_40821","style":1,"background":2000,"log_type":1},{"step":4,"speaker":"医师","content":"这算是好消息还是坏消息？","voice":["vo_event_404008201_04"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_40821","style":1,"background":2000,"log_type":1},{"step":5,"content":"她抬脚把脚边的怪物尸体踹翻，接着无聊地拿着武器在怪物的尸体上划拉，划着划着，忽然，刀锋深深地触及到了某个硬物。","style":3,"background":2000,"log_type":1},{"step":6,"speaker":"医师","content":"嗯？难道……真有惊喜？","voice":["vo_event_404008201_06"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_40821","style":1,"background":2000,"log_type":1},{"step":7,"content":"身旁的队员识趣地蹲下，仔细扒开怪物粗糙的皮，从模糊的血肉中掏出一个形状怪异的物体，仔细端详。","style":3,"background":2000,"log_type":1},{"step":8,"speaker":"医师","content":"这是什么？","voice":["vo_event_404008201_08"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_40821","style":1,"background":2000,"log_type":1},{"step":9,"speaker":"旧军成员","content":"不清楚。但可以肯定，这些怪物不是自然产生的，它们和之前遇到的一样，都是因为这个东西，突然变异或被改造。","voice":["vo_event_404008201_09"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_40821","style":1,"background":2000,"log_type":1},{"step":10,"speaker":"医师","content":"这可不是能随便散养在野外的东西呢……呵呵，你们的主人让你们来这儿做什么？","voice":["vo_event_404008201_10"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_40821","style":1,"background":2000,"log_type":1},{"step":11,"speaker":"医师","content":"来除掉不小心闯入的家伙们吗？","voice":["vo_event_404008201_11"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_40821","style":1,"background":2000,"log_type":1},{"step":12,"content":"通讯器响了。","style":3,"background":2000,"log_type":1},{"step":13,"speaker":"医师","content":"你醒了，今天感觉怎么样？呵呵，虽然想让你多休息会儿，不过来得很是时候，有新发现哦。","voice":["vo_event_404008201_13"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_40821","style":1,"background":2000,"log_type":1},{"step":14,"speaker":"医师","content":"你说的没错，我们也许找对地方了。","voice":["vo_event_404008201_14"],"voice_bank":"vo_event_40821","style":1,"background":2000,"log_type":1},{"step":15,"content":"医师把刚才的发现简短说明了一下，通讯那头安静了几秒，不知道在思考还是又死了。","style":3,"background":2000,"log_type":1},{"step":16,"content":"正当医师想问时， 一个略显虚弱的声音响起。","style":3,"background":2000,"log_type":1},{"step":17,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"……继续深入，这是……难得的机会。","style":11,"background":2000,"log_type":1},{"step":18,"speaker":"${PlayerName}","content":"……在他们转移之前，一定要……","style":11,"background":2000,"log_type":1}]}